+        return "Full effect on faces and skin, 60% on scenery.";
+    case Look::Painterly:
+        return "Experimental: the model is shown a watercolour of the picture and paints its own texture over it.";
+    case Look::SoftCanvas:
+        return "Experimental: skin and surfaces are smoothed before the model sees them, so it paints all fine detail "
+               "itself (detail x2).";
+    case Look::Structure:
+        return "Experimental: the model is shown the picture with fine contrast boosted and paints more surface "
